{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is dark. You\u2019re a robot with a low battery level \u2013 frantically looking for a charging station before your time runs out and you shut down. The only way you can see in the dark is by using your light gun to shoot bouncing balls that leave neon glowing stripes which reveal the environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot to see until you run out of bullets. Your only enemy: time. If you fail, you will reboot. Repeat until you succeed to unlock the next level. Find cute cat companions (dead or alive) along the way and determine their fate by encountering the famous quantum physics thought experiment: to open Schroedinger's box or not to open? Care for your cats by keeping them fed and making sure they don\u2019t get lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve increasingly complex spatial puzzles, experience wave-particle teleporter and relativistic time pickups - don't you worry: they are a mystery to everyone. Compete against other players on a worldwide leader board to see who can beat the levels in the quickest times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axiomatik brings elements of classic Arcade games into VR \u2013 neon graphics against black background and 8-bit synth sounds \u2013 with modern platforming and controls.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969490?t=1769204476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/b64828616fdb214df809ba55e9d74bf94e49f2ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769204476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/9841eee5e33d18861de0dbad2e4b8cf76f7ce8cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769204476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/9841eee5e33d18861de0dbad2e4b8cf76f7ce8cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769204476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is dark. You\u2019re a robot with a low battery level \u2013 frantically looking for a charging station before your time runs out and you shut down. The only way you can see in the dark is by using your light gun to shoot bouncing balls that leave neon glowing stripes which reveal the environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot to see until you run out of bullets. Your only enemy: time. If you fail, you will reboot. Repeat until you succeed to unlock the next level. Find cute cat companions (dead or alive) along the way and determine their fate by encountering the famous quantum physics thought experiment: to open Schroedinger's box or not to open? Care for your cats by keeping them fed and making sure they don\u2019t get lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve increasingly complex spatial puzzles, experience wave-particle teleporter and relativistic time pickups - don't you worry: they are a mystery to everyone. Compete against other players on a worldwide leader board to see who can beat the levels in the quickest times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axiomatik brings elements of classic Arcade games into VR \u2013 neon graphics against black background and 8-bit synth sounds \u2013 with modern platforming and controls.</p>","developers":["J&J"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/bc2a62dede29193f809351d25488fa6ff96f94e7/header.jpg?t=1769204476","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u